Signal ID: Friction-2026-11-27-Shopify-Collective-LocalPickup
Type: Friction
What Changed: 已使用 Shopify Collective（连接供应商与零售商的付费功能）的本地商家，在尝试联合销售并全部以零售商门店自提（local pickup）方式履约时，发现导入产品不支持 local pickup；发生于 2026-11-22 前后，Shopify Support 确认此限制。
Friction: Payment / Fulfillment / Checkout — 混合购物车（双方产品）无法在结账时提供兼容的自提选项，阻断一站式交易完成。
Money: 商家已为 Shopify 订阅及 Collective 功能付费，仍无法完成预期的本地自提联合销售流程。关联损失类型：conversion loss / revenue loss（无法在单一结账完成混合商品自提订单）、潜在 labor cost（若改用分离流程或第三方）。具体金额未知。
Evidence:
1. Shopify Developer Community Forums 原帖（Jessica_Colbert，2026-11-22 10:31pm）：“Shopify Collective doesn’t support local pickup for imported products. When customers add products from both businesses to their cart, checkout cannot offer a compatible pickup method.” 已与 Support  extensively 沟通，确认是 Collective 的 supplier-to-customer shipping model 限制。URL: https://community.shopify.dev/t/shopify-collective-local-pickup-is-there-an-api-or-custom-app-workaround/39993
2. 同帖回复（Shopify 社区）：“local pickup isn’t supported for supplier/imported products. There’s no supported API or checkout extension that can add a pickup option for those items or reroute them while keeping Collective’s automatic routing and payments intact. A third-party fulfillment app works after the order exists, so it can’t make Collective offer local pickup at checkout. This is a Collective limitation, not something a custom app can patch.”
3. 补充事实：Collective 文档与相关分析确认 pickup in store 与 Collective 不兼容（供应商侧与零售商侧均有列出）。
Mechanism: 商家付费使用 Collective 以实现自动订单路由与供应商付款，但平台设计假设配送模型，不支持本地自提场景。当购物车包含导入产品时，结账无法提供统一自提选项，导致交易无法完成或需拆单。推断：此为结构性平台限制，非临时 bug。
